        "jsCode": "// Validate binary presence\nif (!item.binary || !item.binary.data) {\n  throw new Error(\"No binary data found\");\n}\n\n// Patch MIME type if incorrect\nitem.binary.data.mimeType = 'image/jpeg'; // or 'image/png' if needed\n\n// Optional: Rename file for clarity\nitem.binary.data.fileName = 'input.jpg';\n\nreturn item;\n"
